UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='Much of the forest has recovered, but to the south... Everything that Eversong has faced--the Scourge, the fel, and now the Twilight\'s Blade--all that magic leaches into the soil. It builds up in the creatures until they\'re completely overwhelmed...\n\nMy instruments can detect corruption in these animals. We can cull the ones that are too far gone and save the ones that aren\'t. It isn\'t fun... but it\'s for the good of Eversong!', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=91349; -- The Dark Part of the Woods
