UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='Poor Neydra... I knew her, in a previous life. She was full of vitality. Full of ambition. Unfortunately, she let that ambition get the best of her. She grew too enamored with the raw power of the arcane. She became resentful of all other things. Of all other people...\n\nAnd now she is a murderous creature who beheads rats and attacks innocents in a desperate attempt to garner enough arcane energy to slake her unquenchable thirst.\n\nIt\'s funny, the paths life takes us...', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=91265; -- Prey: Neydra the Starving (Nightmare)
