UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogDescription`='Find the Amani elders: Torundo the Grizzled, Doru, and Kinduru.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86719; -- Important Amani
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='De Twilight\'s Blade\'s general, Mor\'duun, has got us by de throat. We\'re not winnin\', and we are too few.\n\nWe\'ve got to evacuate before there\'s no one left--and hope de other tribes meet us at Amani\'Zar.\n\nIn de meantime, I\'m glad to use you while we rally de people of Zul\'Aman. \n\nDe civilians\' lives are my priority. Go to Swiftclaw Terrace and evacuate de people there.\n\nTear through de Twilight\'s Blade as you go. Find your way to Zul\'jan when you\'re done.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86717; -- Show Us Your Worth
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='You might be good at killing, $c, but so are we Amani.\n\nAnd even more de better our weapons!\n\nI took an army into Eversong to reclaim de lightwood forests for de Amani. It was against my sister\'s orders, yes, but lightwood gives us an advantage.\n\nTake back de weapons being stolen by de Twilight\'s Blade, and I\'ll show you why it was worth de effort.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86716; -- Armed by Light
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='If you want to survive here in Atal\'Aman, find and beat de city\'s battle drums. Dat will rally our remainin\' soldiers forward to join de fight.\n\nIt will also bring all de tribes of Zul\'Aman--de Witherbark, de Revantusk, and de Shadowpine--to our aid and tell our civilians to retreat to de Altar of Malacrass if we need to evacuate.\n\nUse de drums to spread de word. Find me at de Altar of Malacrass when you are done.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86711; -- Amani Clarion Call
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `LogTitle`='The Line Must Be Drawn Here', `LogDescription`='Speak to Zul\'jan and defuse the situation.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86710; -- The Line Must be Drawn Here
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='The loa speaker talks of fire in de heart--in all hearts.\n\nJan\'alai is de loa of birth, death, and rebirth. Maybe de loa speaker is askin\' for sacrifice.\n\n<Zul\'jarra smiles deviously.>\n\nHey, Liadrin. How much fire you think is in an elf\'s heart, eh?\n\n<Liadrin gives her a sour look.>\n\nHeh.\n\nWhatever de loa speaker wants, it is either part of resurrectin\' de loa or part of de trial. Let\'s see what he has do say.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86663; -- Embers to a Flame
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `FlagsEx2`=0x2000, `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86645; -- Hidden Quest [DNT]
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='Magister Umbric--he\'s second only to Mother in mastering the Void. If anyone can help us with that storm in the sky, he\'s the one who can make it happen... if he can forgive the others for not listening to him in the first place. \n\nAt least Lor\'themar saw reason. There\'s no way we can take the fight to Xal\'atath without Umbric.\n\nThe forces keeping the Voidstorm at bay will only hold out so long. Let\'s make haste.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=86621; -- The Wayward Magister
