UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Flags`=0x590000, `FlagsEx3`=0x1, `QuestDescription`='All that yet stands between me and the temple is Prophet Jammal\'an himself. He is the leader of the Atal\'ai trolls here, a foul manipulator.$B$BKnow that you do not face a mere crazed troll, $n, but an instrument of forces beyond your darkest comprehension. Yet you do not fight alone--my strength and the will of the Green Dragonflight go with you.$B$BProceed to the Den of the Caller, left through the Hall of Ritual, and then down into the Hall of Bones. At the bottom, you will find Jammal\'an.', `PortraitGiverText`='Leader of the Atal\'ai.', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=27773; -- Step Three: Prophet
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Flags`=0x590000, `FlagsEx3`=0x1, `QuestDescription`='The trolls here perpetuate the fall of my brethren to the nightmare. They infect and corrupt green dragons with the blood of their foul god, and then harvest the evil that has grown within them. They are being farmed like livestock...$B$BThis disgusting savagery cannot continue. Return to where you left the Hall of Masks and take the other corridor toward the Butchery. Gomora the Bloodletter harvests corpses for these foul and evil rituals there. Take his undeserved life from him!', `VerifiedBuild`=69497 WHERE `ID`=27768; -- Step Two: The Bloodletter
